      "knowledge_id": "FIELD_TASK_BOUNDARY_001",
      "topic": "field_task_boundary",
      "statement": "A field walk can record what is visible on the visit date in mapped water areas or seller-named places. It cannot prove year-round reliability, water quality, legal right, or stocking. If access paper has not supported an entrance, do not send the trip.",
      "source_id": "SRC_FIELD_BOUND_001",
      "source_title": "What a ranch visit can and cannot establish",
