      "topic": "legal_access",
      "statement": "Road contact with a public-road layer is not proof of a recorded legal entrance. Ask title or counsel for the deed, a recorded easement, the entrance location, maintenance duty, and exceptions. Do not treat the answer as a finding that a right exists or is missing.",
