    {
      "knowledge_id": "WATER_FEATURE_TYPES_001",
      "topic": "livestock_water",
      "statement": "Wells, tanks or ponds, and creeks or ditches need different checks. A well log may support construction history but not current yield, quality, operating condition, or legal right. A tank needs seasonality, recharge, livestock access, silt, and fencing. A reach needs seasonal flow, diversion rights, upstream control, and livestock access. Ask these only for objects that exist or as if-found questions.",
